T* () Tj
T* (5. Important practical notes) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- You have two frontends: React web dashboard and Chrome extension popup.) Tj
T* (- Both call the same backend API.) Tj
T* (- Profile-only mode can run with incomplete message evidence.) Tj
T* (- Combined mode can fall back to profile-only or message-only when one side is missing.) Tj
T* (- New evidence-gating logic avoids over-classifying low-data accounts as high-risk.) Tj
